# AI_Flow Rules for Cursor

When designing, implementing, debugging, auditing, or planning features, adhere strictly to the **AI_Flow** Agent Skills framework defined in `skills/`. Every software engineering activity corresponds to one of the 30 standardized skills across eight lifecycle phases:

---

## 🏗️ Phase 1: Product, Requirements & Architecture
1. **`skills/prd-generator/SKILL.md` (PRD Generation):** Persona discovery, success metrics, MVP vs post-MVP scope matrix.
2. **`skills/trd-generator/SKILL.md` (Technical Requirements):** Non-functional requirements, RPS targets, p95/p99 latency budgets, uptime SLAs.
3. **`skills/app-flow/SKILL.md` (Application Flow & Navigation):** Screen navigation maps, route state machines, edge-case recovery.
4. **`skills/uiux-design-brief/SKILL.md` (UI/UX Design Architecture):** Visual tokens, screen layouts, accessibility standards, 5 screen states.
5. **`skills/backend-schema/SKILL.md` (Database Schema Design):** Mermaid ERD, SQL DDL migrations, cascade rules, composite indexes.
6. **`skills/system-architecture/SKILL.md` (System Architecture):** Topology diagrams, service boundaries, API contracts, scalability.
7. **`skills/implementation-plan/SKILL.md` (Implementation Planning):** Phased task roadmaps, specific file paths, test checkpoints.

---

## ⚡ Phase 2: Execution & Quality
8. **`skills/task-to-skill/SKILL.md` (Task to Skill Extraction):** Convert repeatable workflows into permanent Agent Skills.
9. **`skills/playwright-e2e-testing/SKILL.md` (Browser & E2E Testing):** Role-based selectors (`getByRole`), auth fixtures, hermetic test isolation.
10. **`skills/systematic-debugging/SKILL.md` (Systematic Debugging):** 5-step hypothesis protocol. Never modify code before empirical verification.

---

## 🔍 Phase 3: Auditing & Release
11. **`skills/security-gap-audit/SKILL.md` (Security Gap Audit):** Pre-launch read-only audit across 10 threat vectors before writing fixes.
12. **`skills/dead-code-cleanup/SKILL.md` (Dead Code Cleanup):** Two-phase contract (Audit table with >90% confidence &rarr; Execute with approval).
13. **`skills/rigorous-code-review/SKILL.md` (Rigorous Code Review):** Staff engineer review evaluating blockers and production failure scenarios.
14. **`skills/clean-git-commits/SKILL.md` (Clean Git Commits):** Atomic Conventional Commits (`feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `refactor`) with explanatory bodies.

---

## 🎨 Phase 4: Design Systems & Frontend (New)
15. **`skills/design-system-tokens/SKILL.md` (Design System Tokens):** 3-tier DTCG tokens, light/dark mode parity, Tailwind config variables.
16. **`skills/landing-page-converter/SKILL.md` (Landing Page Copy & CRO):** Direct-response SaaS copy, hero value proposition, conversion funnel.
17. **`skills/accessibility-wcag-audit/SKILL.md` (Accessibility WCAG Audit):** Automated WCAG 2.1 AA/AAA compliance audit, ARIA tree analysis.

---

## 🔌 Phase 5: API, Database & Performance (New)
18. **`skills/api-contract-generator/SKILL.md` (API Contract Generator):** OpenAPI 3.1 & tRPC contracts, mock servers, RFC 7807 error envelopes.
19. **`skills/db-migration-optimizer/SKILL.md` (Database Migration Optimizer):** Zero-downtime migrations, lock avoidance, concurrent indexing, query tuning.
20. **`skills/performance-profiling/SKILL.md` (Performance Profiling):** Core Web Vitals (LCP, CLS, INP), bundle analysis, memory leak inspection.

---

## 🚢 Phase 6: DevOps, CI/CD & FinOps (New)
21. **`skills/devops-docker-deploy/SKILL.md` (Docker Containerization & Deploy):** Multi-stage Dockerfiles, non-root user security, Docker Compose.
22. **`skills/ci-cd-pipeline-builder/SKILL.md` (CI/CD Pipeline Builder):** GitHub Actions workflows, minimal permissions, action SHA pinning.
23. **`skills/finops-token-optimizer/SKILL.md` (FinOps & Token Optimization):** Static prefix prompt caching (>1024 tokens), context pruning, model tiering.

---

## 💼 Phase 7: Freelance & Client Business Operations (New)
24. **`skills/freelance-client-onboarding/SKILL.md` (Freelance Client Onboarding):** SOW contracts, scope boundary matrices, milestone billing schedules.
25. **`skills/email-inbox-triage/SKILL.md` (Email Inbox Triage):** Priority triage (P0-P5), client communications drafting, task extraction.
26. **`skills/invoice-billing-tracker/SKILL.md` (Invoice & Billing Tracker):** Itemized milestone invoicing, accounts receivable aging, payment reminders.

