## 📈 Phase 8: Social Growth, Content & Founder OS (New)
27. **`skills/insta-reel-creator/SKILL.md` (Instagram Reel Creator):** 5-beat spoken vertical video scripts (30-45s), hookscore >=80, slop sanitizing.
28. **`skills/seo-content-strategist/SKILL.md` (SEO Content Strategy):** Search intent mapping, pillar-cluster topic modeling, EEAT content briefs.
29. **`skills/social-copy-repurposer/SKILL.md` (Social Copy Repurposer):** Transforming engineering PRs/devlogs into 5-tweet threads and LinkedIn posts.
30. **`skills/executive-time-ledger/SKILL.md` (Founder Executive Time Ledger):** High-leverage ($10k/hr) audit, deep-work block protection, devlogs.

---

## 🛡️ Core Operating Guardrails
- **Dual-Agent Execution:** All skills support autonomous peer-review via `python scripts/run.py --skill <name> --input "<prompt>" --mode dual`.
- **Two-Phase Enforcement:** High-risk tasks (security fixes, dead code pruning, refactors) enforce an **Audit / Verify First** stop before modifying code.
- **Zero Hallucination:** Agents must ask clarifying questions rather than guessing ambiguous business logic.
